## Metadata

- Artefact: S04 Driver, Goal and Objective Catalogue
- Phase: a
- Purpose: Record why S04 exists and what it must achieve: one declaration per invocable operation, from which manifest, OpenAPI operation, MCP tool and route are generated so HTTP and MCP cannot diverge.
- Scope: S04 action registry slice. It replaces the 24 node packages and fr's 88 capability declarations; later slices add actions, never a surface. Domain actions (S05-S11), kind: workflow (S13), channel-mcp delivery rows (S06) and the signed mcp_server channel (S06-alpha) are out of scope.

## Entries

- **Driver / Four artifacts drifting** - {"detail": "fr's registry is the lesson: any projection reading a second source is the bug. S04 derives every projection from one ActionSpec.", "objective": "Remove the drift surface between HTTP, MCP, manifest and OpenAPI."}
- **Driver / Legacy surface proliferation** - {"detail": "Later slices add actions, never a surface.", "objective": "Replace 24 node packages and fr's 88 capability declarations with one registry."}
- **Goal / Gate SPEC section 8 S4** - {"detail": "The gate covers the 16 internal actions plus the four fixtures.* external actions.", "objective": "20 actions identical over HTTP and MCP."}
- **Objective / Single declaration** - {"detail": "The attribute supplies name, version, kind, scopes, idempotent, timeout_ms, effect, confirm and tenancy.", "objective": "ActionSpec plus #[action] emit the spec value and an inventory::submit! from the same tokens."}
- **Objective / Fail-closed registry** - {"detail": "It fails on a duplicate name, an MCP-form collision, an MCP name outside the charset, a handler-less internal action or an unknown Scope.", "objective": "assert_registry_consistent runs in serve, worker and every test."}
- **Objective / Invocation integrity** - {"detail": "One transaction writes the mutation, action_invocation and audit_event; S04 declares no events, so it writes no outbox row.", "objective": "Compose tenancy scope, idempotency claim, deadline and transaction around every call."}
- **Objective / External integration** - {"detail": "Store spec and schema_hash; refuse a breaking refresh until conveyor admin actions approve <name> --version <n>.", "objective": "Ingest external OpenAPI operations as kind: external actions."}
- **Objective / MCP parity and fail-closed access** - {"detail": "A refused tool is absent, not noisy; an unresolvable tenant is 401 and a failed JWT bearer is never retried as a licence token.", "objective": "Serve MCP tools from the same Registry, scope-filtered."}
